window.products.push({"id":706023,"name":"Bad Boy Bacon Maker for Microwave - Crispy Bacon Cooker For Microwave Oven - Breakfast Maker for Crispy, Healthy, and Low Fat Bacon Cooking - Pack of ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712J-l3QAyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"In the Box: Includes 2 Microwave Bacon Cooker that cooks healthy and crispy bacon within minutes. Cooks Up To 6 Slices: Add up to 6 slices per bacon maker, snap the strap, and microwave for crispy bacon in microwave! Conveniently-sized bacon cooker for microwave oven that fits even in the smallest microwave oven. Healthy Cooking: Our bacon microwave cookware is designed to reduce fat. The fat drains away through the specially designed holes leaving healthier, crispier, and low fat bacon. Tip: When used for shorter durations, badboy bacon maker can be used as a bacon warmer. Easy-to-Clean: Dishwasher safe for hassle-free cleaning, or use dish soap and warm water. The bacon does not stick to our silicone bacon cooker for microwave oven! NOTE: Not intended for use with butcher-cut thick bacon, which does not cook well in a microwave oven. Bad Boy Bacon maker microwave bacon tray/food tray also available!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712J-l3QAyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bad Boy Bacon","source_asin":"B09GKB5C8V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-706023","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GKB5C8V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GKB5C8V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":706024,"name":"Curtis Stone Pop Out Round Cake Pan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91KXMOT+kvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Pop Out Bakeware is a revolutionary new line of bakeware from Curtis Stone. Each Pop Out pan features and innovative combination of cold rolled stainless steel and flexible silicone. The thick rolled edges prevent warping, even at high temperatures. The large handles on both sides allow for easy gripping without sticking the thumbs of your oven mitts in the pan. The durable non-tick coating makes for even browning and the silicone construction provides easy release and prevents baked goods from sticking. The FDA-grade silicone is heat-safe to 500 degrees Fahrenheit. Hand washing is recommended. Available in a variety of styles and sizes. After years of experience as a professional chef, Curtis Stone has created a premium line of kitchen items that solve common problems home chefs come up against. This sleek looking range of products promotes efficiency in the kitchen and improves the quality and taste of your food. Designed by Curtis and based on thousands of hours in professional and domestic kitchens throughout the world, every item is aimed to enhance the cooking experience. In his own words: “As a chef, I’ve always had the luxury of working in professional kitchens, where I have everything at my fingertips – huge cutting boards, razor sharp knives, large garbage bins at every station, the list goes on and on. I’ve also worked in hundreds of domestic kitchens and I know first-hand the issues that home cooks go up against - anything from blunt knives and unstable chopping boards to limited space. To me cooking should be fun and should never stand in the way of spending time with family and friends. There is no better gift to give someone than a home cooked meal so I have designed a unique range of kitchen solutions that will save you time in the kitchen and make your life a lot easier. You will be so proud of the food that you can effortlessly put on the table, you won't be able to wipe the smile off your face. Bon Appetit!”","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91KXMOT+kvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Curtis Stone","source_asin":"B007X6F7SE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-706024","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007X6F7SE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007X6F7SE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
