window.products.push({"id":706098,"name":"Sunshine Joy Blue Flower Hippie Mini Tapestry 30 x 45 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jO29AIXDL._AC_SL1296_.jpg","description":"Blue Flower Mini Tapestry - Fabric Poster - Amaze your friends and family with this intricately designed, mini tapestry - 100% Cotton - Measures 30x45 inches - Just so there's no confusion, our tapestries are printed not quilted or woven; they're designed as wall hangings and not as fitted sheets. Each corner is affixed with a sturdy loop for easy hanging or beach staking. That said, they still look cool as Indian-style bed spreads - They also make great beach and picnic sheets, sun canopies, super-hero capes (powers not included), togas, ceiling décor, couch covers, window curtains, and psychedelic ghost costumes - Please Note: Our tapestries are printed on the front side only.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jO29AIXDL._AC_SL1296_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sunshine Joy","source_asin":"B00NWS0868","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-706098","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00NWS0868","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00NWS0868","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":706099,"name":"BUZIO Insulated Water Bottle with Straw Lid, 40oz Tumbler Travel Flask, Double Wall Vacuum Insulated Stainless Steel Leak Proof Tumbler, Fits Any Car ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cWUKd1shL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"40 oz Travel Water Bottle: Featuring a revolutionary T-shape design, plus a sleek and slim outline, BUZIO Insulated Water Bottle fits snugly in any standard cup holder with significantly increased capacity. Just travel wherever beats your heart without worrying about hydration. Insulated Water Bottle: BUZIO 40 oz double-wall vacuum insulated water bottle features unique ThermoArmour technology that creates a unique insulated atmosphere. It keeps icy drink cold for up to 48 hours and hot beverages warm for up to 24 hours. Plus the excellent sealing lid, you can simply grab and go. Two Ways to Drink: This 40oz stainless steel water bottle comes with a straw lid and a flex cap for easy sipping or swigging on the go. Its 2.16\" wide mouth makes cleaning and ice filling much easier. Stainless Steel Water Bottle: Crafted with 100% non-toxic BPA-free plastics & durable food-grade 18/8 stainless steel, the water bottle is free of any flavor or metal rust. Savor fresh beer or coffee freely no matter where you are. Lifetime Warranty: It comes with a BUZIO 40oz Insulated Water Bottle, a straw lid, a flex cap, 2 straws and a cleaning brush, backed by our worry-free lifetime warranty and friendly customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cWUKd1shL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BUZIO","source_asin":"B09KRR9CW7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-706099","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KRR9CW7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KRR9CW7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":706100,"name":"Ananda Woodworking Meditation Bench Canvas Tote Bag (Natural/Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71a05PxXyzL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Product Description These handmade meditation benches are perfect for taking the pressure off your ankles while kneeling during meditation. So many \"westerners\" are unused to kneeling that many of us simply can't use the traditional position for any length of time. These benches take all the pressure off the ankles and vastly ease the pressure on the knees. The first time you use one a HUGE smile will creep over your face as you realize how much more comfortable it is than a pillow or even a non-padded bench. These are created one at a time by Ananda Woodworking of out of their shop in California. We love these benches since they are clearly made with a great deal of attention to their finish and detail - plus the padding holds up to lots of use. While these are \"technically\" the TALL version of the bench, we know people from 5' to 6'2\" have found them perfectly comfortable. Most people find the tall a bit more comfortable simply because your knees don't have to bend quite as much. The tops have a layer of foam covered with cotton batting and topped by cotton fabric. Of course you can get meditation benches with a wood top, but these are so much more comfortable. A nice heavy hinge on both legs lets them fold flat - perfect for travel or just stowing out of the way. They are a little stiff on purpose so they won't flop open (or closed) and they don't make any noise if you shift during a group class session. We usually have at least a couple different colors in stock. If you're buying for someone else, \"black\" or \"natural\" is usually pretty safe. The \"in-store favorite\" is Burgundy - almost a \"plum\" color. Very nice if we have them in stock. Though do be careful as we understand not ALL vendors selling this bench under this listing are selling \"Tall\" benches. From the Manufacturer These handmade meditation benches are perfect for taking the pressure off your ankles while kneeling during meditation. So many \"westerners\" are unused to kneeling that many of us simply can't use the traditional position for any length of time. These benches take all the pressure off the ankles and vastly ease the pressure on the knees. The first time you use one a HUGE smile will creep over your face as you realize how much more comfortable it is than a pillow or even a non-padded bench. These are created one at a time by Ananda Woodworking of out of their shop in California. We love these benches since they are clearly made with a great deal of attention to their finish and detail - plus the padding holds up to lots of use. While these are \"technically\" the TALL version of the bench, we know people from 5' to 6'2\" have found them perfectly comfortable. Most people find the tall a bit more comfortable simply because your knees don't have to bend quite as much. The tops have a layer of foam covered with cotton batting and topped by cotton fabric. Of course you can get meditation benches with a wood top, but these are so much more comfortable. A nice heavy hinge on both legs lets them fold flat - perfect for travel or just stowing out of the way. They are a little stiff on purpose so they won't flop open (or closed) and they don't make any noise if you shift during a group class session. We usually have at least a couple different colors in stock. If you're buying for someone else, \"black\" or \"natural\" is usually pretty safe. The \"in-store favorite\" is Burgundy - almost a \"plum\" color. Very nice if we have them in stock. Though do be careful as we understand not ALL vendors selling this bench under this listing are selling \"Tall\" benches.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71a05PxXyzL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ananda Woodworking","source_asin":"B002JIHQ5S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-706100","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002JIHQ5S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002JIHQ5S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
