window.products.push({"id":706177,"name":"omgogo Insulated Travel Mug & Coffee Mugs Stainless Steel Lid Lock Prevents Leaks (12 (oz), pink)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OIB7kYvzL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Travel Mug - Keeps Drinks Hot & Fresh For Hours. When it comes to so-called leak proof travel mugs, you've been burned. LITERALLY. There's nothing worse than heading into a meeting with coffee stains all over your shirt! But with the omgogo insulated travel coffee mug, leaks are a distant memory. The unique vertical safety lock on the lid seals in your liquid securely to prevent leaks and accidental spills. Thanks to innovative vacuum insulation technology, air is sucked out to create a vacuum between the double walls, minimizing the effect of outside temperature. Your coffee or tea stays piping hot, fresh, and delicious for up to 6 hour sand cold drinks stay chilled. The Omgogo mug looks great, too! Crafted from premium stainless steel, it comes in an array of colors, with an attractive baked finish that resists fingerprints. Whether you're going camping, hiking, or just have a long commute, this thermos is the perfect travel companion! - Double-wall construction for excellent insulation - Convenient one-hand operation - Push-button flip-top lid - Food-grade stainless steel - Lid locks to prevent accidental spills - Keeps liquids hot for up to 8 hours - Great quality, solid and sturdy - Holds 16.9 oz. of liquid - BPA-free - Drink from it directly, or pour into cup - Easy to clean - Fits most car cup holders (2.6\" D, 9\" H) - Great gift for men & women. The results is a corrosion resistant surface that repels foreign substances and stains, creating a smooth and ultra clean stainless steel environment for your drinks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OIB7kYvzL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"omgogo","source_asin":"B013G4592K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-706177","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B013G4592K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B013G4592K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":706178,"name":"Kenney KN55971 Davenport Ball End Petite Café Decorative Window Curtain Rod, 48-86\" Adjustable Length, Brushed Nickel Finish, 1/2\" Diameter Steel Tube","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.27,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612xnViHBPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add a touch of style to your home with the Davenport Petite Café Window Curtain Rod by Kenney. The 1/2 inch diameter Davenport curtain rod in brushed nickel is a simple way to add style to smaller windows. Use in your kitchen and bathroom to hang lightweight café curtains, sheers, and valances. The telescoping rod adjusts from 48 inches to 86 inches to fit your window and projects 2.75 inches from the wall. It is ideal for hanging curtains with pockets, back tabs, and tab tops, but can also be used with clip rings. Drapery Hardware Set Includes: one telescoping steel curtain rod with decorative molded plastic finials (1.68\" L x 1.15\" W x 1.15\" H), two mounting brackets, one center support, screws, drywall anchors, and installation instructions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612xnViHBPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kenney","source_asin":"B0C4ZLMBR3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-706178","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4ZLMBR3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4ZLMBR3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
