window.products.push({"id":706233,"name":"Butterfly Craze Artificial Lavender 4-Piece Bundle – Lifelike Faux Silk Plants for Crafting or Home Decor – Great for Pairing With Other Fake/Dried Fl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bDNjfotwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MODERN FARMHOUSE DECOR: Features rustic & timeless purple faux silk flowers with stems that add a touch of elegance to any home or office. With their effortless charm & French countryside appeal, these allergy-free artificial flowers require no water or tending, making them a practical & low-maintenance addition to any space. If you want to brighten up a dull corner or create a focal point on a coffee table, these faux silk flowers are the perfect solution for those seeking a touch of beauty. SIZE: This bundle of artificial lavender sprigs is a versatile decoration item for any space. Each sprig measures between 14.5\" and 16.5\", making them perfect for table centerpieces. They also work well as accents on office desks, bathroom shelves, and entryway tables. The lifelike design and vibrant colors make them a great way to add a touch of nature to any room without the hassle of maintaining real plants. Plus, the bundle can be easily rearranged to suit your changing decor needs. PERFECT FOR WEDDING OR CRAFTING: With their realistic appearance, they can be used for bridal bouquets, bridesmaids' hair accessories, and wedding table centerpieces. They also make great accents for flower baskets or wreaths. Unlike real flowers, these sprigs will never wilt or fade, making them a long-lasting choice for any occasion. Whether you're looking to add a touch of elegance to your wedding or create a beautiful DIY project, these faux lavender sprigs are a must-have. REALISTIC & VERSATILE: These lifelike stems are so convincing that even your most discerning guests will have to touch them to believe they're not real. Whether you choose to display them indoors or outdoors, they're sure to bring a touch of natural beauty to any setting. The flowers are crafted with careful attention to detail, capturing the essence of real lavender in stunning detail. Plus, their sturdy construction means they're durable enough for use in your garden or patio. TIMELESS ELEGANCE: Bring beauty & serenity into your home with Butterfly Craze's premium artificial lavender plants. Each plant is crafted from high-quality faux silk flowers and other materials, creating a lifelike and long-lasting decoration. Perfect for those who want the calming presence of lavender without the upkeep, these plants require no watering or pruning. Please note that the pictured vases are not included, allowing you to choose your own style & setting for these beautiful plants.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bDNjfotwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Butterfly Craze","source_asin":"B08XVP19Y8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-706233","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XVP19Y8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XVP19Y8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
