window.products.push({"id":706281,"name":"Better World Bio Bread Basket with Terracotta Warmer, Bread Basket, Bread Basket for Serving, Sized 12.5\" w x 8.5\" d x 3.5\" h","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41B4na3Z3gL._AC_.jpg","description":"What's better than the smell of warm bread? Nothing! Our bread basket, handwoven from kaisa grass with palm wrap, comes with a terra cotta bread warmer that fits perfectly inside the basket! Basket: Rinse with water. Do not rub stains or spills from your basket. Not dishwasher safe. Use and Care instructions: Rinse before first use. Dry well. Preheat oven to 350°F. Place terracotta stone in oven and bake for 10 minutes. Do not put basket in oven. Handle carefully, place stone in basket. For best results, wrap food in towel and place on warmer. To clean, rinse with water. Not dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41B4na3Z3gL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Better World Bio","source_asin":"B09LRDYR27","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-706281","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LRDYR27","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LRDYR27","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
