window.products.push({"id":706288,"name":"Nearly Natural 28in. Cymbidium Orchid, Bromeliad, Croton and Pothos Artificial Silk Plants, Orange","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816AkIkRS3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add undeniable flair to your everyday interiors with this artificial arrangement Boasting a mix of delicate Cymbidium orchids blooms, highlighted with an electric-colored silk bromeliad, complemented with the explosive coloring of the croton plant and finished with hints of Pothos greenery. Reaching 28” tall from its accompanying planter, This sophisticated plant is a handsome addition to home decor. About Nearly Natural - for over 75 years, Nearly Natural Has been providing conscientious consumers with beautiful alternatives to natural decorations. Employed and advised by naturalists who understand the live plant world, Nearly Natural is able to recreate the most realistic-looking decorative items for homes, offices, and businesses. Driven by a true commitment to customer service, attention to detail, and natural philosophy, Nearly Natural strives to bring customers The most beautiful, unique, and striking faux plants and floral on the market. Silk arrangements are manufactured using synthetic materials, such as polyester material or plastic, and are well designed and constructed to be life-like in appearance. This item may need to be re-shaped when removed from the secure box to allow it to reach its fullest size. Your silk plant will look beautiful for years to come; simply wipe clean with a soft dry cloth when needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816AkIkRS3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nearly Natural","source_asin":"B07T9P115T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-706288","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07T9P115T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07T9P115T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
