window.products.push({"id":706359,"name":"HECHZSO Coasters for Drinks. 6 PCs Square Cork Coasters. Colorful Heat-Resistant Reusable 4 inch Cold/Hot Drinks Wine Glasses Cups & Mugs Coasters Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uvPAA4LqS._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"✅【Natural Cork】Made with 100% Portuguese natural cork and eco-friendly EVA (unrecycled material). ✅【Practical and Beautiful】The advantages of this cork coaster: non-slip, quiet, natural, healthy, beautiful. In addition to protecting cups and table tops, prevent stains on table furniture. It is more about the taste that embellishes the living space. Please feel the quiet soft moment when the cup is placed on the coaster. ✅【EXCLUSIVE DESIGN】This coaster is 4 inches square and 5mm thick. Our designers chose bright pieces of EVA to combine with rustic cork to give this coaster a natural, new and unique look. There are obvious differences from ordinary pure cork coasters. ✅ Of course, if you like pure cork coasters, please visit our store for other coasters. ✅【Multiple Uses and Great Gifts】Perfect for everyday use at home, office, bar, etc, making it a great gift for anyone on any holiday, Christmas, Thanksgiving, Valentine's Day, etc. ✅【Warm Tips】Note: The water absorption of cork is not as good as that of sponge, but better than that of ceramics and solid wood. Typically, coasters will dry up in about 5-10 minutes. Of course, you can also wipe it clean with a paper towel or towel. If you have high requirements for water absorption, please do not buy it. If you don't like EVA, don't buy it either. Everyone has their own aesthetics and needs. ✅【Satisfaction Guaranteed】We are committed to providing customers with quality products and satisfactory service. Any quality problems, please feel free to contact us. Provide the best service to every customer who chooses us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uvPAA4LqS._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HECHZSO","source_asin":"B0B9WDTFMM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-706359","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9WDTFMM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9WDTFMM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
