window.products.push({"id":706361,"name":"Bilik Shower Wall Clocks (Set of 2) - Water Resistant Colorful Fun Childrens Bathroom Accesssories - Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816LIXeUGKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Each set comes with; 2 clocks (you choose color variation) 2-AAA batteries. Every child loves having play time in the tub or being in the shower, forever. But that is the rare morning or evening in most households. With our hectic lives, and many areas of the country having water restrictions, we could all use a little help not wasting time in the shower. Wouldn't it be great for you or your child to be more aware of how much time you are spending in the shower? with the colorful Bilik wall clocks in your shower stall, you and your kids can enjoy every minute spent in the shower, and know exactly how much time you have left. The clocks have a large silicone suction cup on the backside, so you stick the clocks to any smooth tile, fiberglass, ceramic, or glass surface, in your shower for easy viewing of the time. Clocks will not stick to drywall surfaces. These cute clocks are encased with an air-tight silicone layer over the plastic face, so water can spray right on it without affecting it from properly functioning. chose the spot where you or your kids can easily see the clock while in the shower; wet the back surface of the suction cup on the clock and press it up against that area of the shower wall. It will stay, forever.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816LIXeUGKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bilik","source_asin":"B0124NYDVM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-706361","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0124NYDVM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0124NYDVM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
