window.products.push({"id":706389,"name":"Nuwave Flex Precision Induction Cooktop, Portable, Large 6.5” Heating Coil, 10.25” Shatter-Proof Ceramic Glass, 3 Watt Settings, 4Qt Induction-Ready H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":131.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614Y+4ac3aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MAKE ADJUSTMENTS ON-THE-FLY – Want hotter temperature or need to cook it longer? No problem. Simply adjust on-the-fly any time. No need to start over. Flex’s intuitive digital controls are easy to operate, and the response is immediate. 45 PRE-PROGRAMMED TEMPS - Select from the 6 convenient preset temperature settings or fine tune your own temperature from 100°F to 500°F in 10°F increments. You can also add or deduct cooking time at any time. SHATTER-PROOF CERAMIC GLASS – The heating surface is heavy-duty shatter-proof ceramic glass. It was rigorously tested to withstand intense heat without shattering. It is one of the safest cooktops on the market. FAST & EFFICIENT – Flex heats the pot directly transferring 85%~90% of its electro-magnetic energy to heat energy! Traditional stovetops only convert about 30% of their heat for cooking. Flex cooks faster; saves energy; and is safer than any stovetop. SAFETY BUILT-IN – Even if you forget, Flex will shut off automatically when the set cook time is completed. When the cookware is removed from the cooktop, Flex will not start. There are no hot coils or open flames reducing the risk of burns and fire. PERFECT FOR DORMS & RV’S – Flex is light-weight and portable. It performs flawlessly in RV’s, dorms, campsites, and smaller apartments. Its 3 wattage settings of 600, 900 & 1300 watts are designed to work well anywhere even when the power is limited. PROGRAMMABLE FUNCTIONS – With Flex, you can sear, boil, simmer, fry, deep fry, sauté, slow cook, melt, or simply re-heat or keep warm. The applications are endless. Now it’s easy to prepare healthy, great tasting meals with a touch of a button. SUPERIOR TECHNOLOGY - The slim design of Flex and its patented insulation technology brings the induction heating coils closer to your cookware than the competition for faster & even heating, ensuring no hot or cold spots for optimal cooking experience. CHEF INSPIRED FEATURES & FUNCTIONS – Every feature and function of Flex are created and rigorously tested by highly trained NUWAVE chefs and RD team. We obsessed over every detail in pursuit of optimal performance and durability. 4QT DURALON BLUE CERAMIC FRYING PAN INCLUDED – Ultra-nonstick healthy ceramic, induction-ready frying pan is non-toxic, lid included, PTFE & PFOA free, oven safe, and compatible with all cooktops.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614Y+4ac3aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nuwave","source_asin":"B00DP6BJE2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-706389","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00DP6BJE2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00DP6BJE2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
