window.products.push({"id":706497,"name":"Entertaining with Caspari Christmas Tree Paper Lunch Napkin Package","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91RLYPaAJ6S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Christmas Tree Paper Lunch Napkin Package in ivory represents festive Caspari design and feel. This set of 20 lunch napkins is great for formal and casual entertaining this holiday season. The triple-ply napkins are printed exclusively for Caspari in Germany using the softest tissue printable. These Christmas Tree napkins are made to resemble linen napkins using non-toxic, water soluble dyes. These napkins however are 100% disposable, so you can enjoy your time with friends and family more, and clean up less! And Caspari is commited to producing their products with the use of enviromently sound raw materials, so you can feel even better about entertaining with their products. Bring elegence into your home everyday with the Caspari Christmas Tree Lunch Napkin. Be creative with Caspari style. Amazon.com The Christmas Tree paper tableware collection from Caspari honors a bygone era, when cherished gifts might have included a wooden rocking horse or wind-up jack-in-the-box. These 6-1/2-by-6-1/2-inch lunch napkins with their red border, green decorated tree, and old-fashioned toys on an ivory background make an appealing, carefree alternative to real linen. Matching paper plates in both dinner and salad/dessert size are available, creating a fully coordinated table for those holiday parties when minimal cleanup is desired. Caspari is committed to environmentally sound practices. Much of the paper used in Caspari products comes from a company that uses 100% wind power for its electricity and uses fibers from sustainably harvested trees. No chlorine is used in the bleaching process. A European company prints the napkins using only non-toxic, water-soluble dyes on the softest printable paper possible. It's hard to throw out such beautiful paper products after use, but if you're a gardener, take heart: the paper napkins and towels are biodegradable and can be composted. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91RLYPaAJ6S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Caspari","source_asin":"B000VL6XBS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-706497","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000VL6XBS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000VL6XBS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":706498,"name":"Totally Bamboo Salt Box, Medium","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51q+WaSfIbL._AC_.jpg","description":"Totally Bamboo's Salt Box is cute, simple and easy to use. This salt box has an easy slide-off top that rotates a full 360-degrees and a wide opening that allows plenty of room for larger hands or spoons to reach in to grab your favorite seasoning. No stains or paint are used to create the Salt Box's scrumptious honey shade. This color is created in a very specialized heating process which caramelizes the natural sugar in the wood; it is permanent and will not fade or wash out. Wash with warm water and mild detergent and occasionally wipe with mineral oil (Do not clean in the dishwasher). From the original bamboo cutting board company, Totally Bamboo, this salt box is a beautiful and functional addition to any kitchen. Bamboo is the natural alternative for all things wood. It is the fastest growing plant on our planet and does not require any special care to grow. In fact, it is a grass that produces more oxygen than a hard wood forest of comparable size, it helps to reduce carbon dioxide gases blamed for global warming, and it helps to prevent soil erosion through its widespread root system and large canopy. At Totally Bamboo, we are proud to say we use only the highest quality bamboo, harvested at the optimum age of 5 years from our own bamboo forests. There are over 1200 species of bamboo; however, we choose to use “Moso” timber bamboo for its strength, density and versatility. As an added bonus, it is not a habitat for pandas. Our factories adhere to a very stringent protocol for curing and processing the bamboo, ensuring the highest quality product. We take steps to ensure that our employees are well taken care of and work in a safe and hazard free environment. Our goal is continuous improvement through design, developing new, unique and innovative products which appeal to the environmentally conscious.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51q+WaSfIbL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Totally Bamboo","source_asin":"B001FOPU0U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-706498","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001FOPU0U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001FOPU0U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":706499,"name":"Georgetown Pottery Round Ikebana Flower Vase, Light Purple Zen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51aox22s3HL._AC_.jpg","description":"Georgetown Pottery Ikebana Vases are designed to be simple, graceful and elegant. Our Ikebana vases are nationally known and sold in galleries, showrooms and gift shops across the country. Each vase is designed to accentuate all parts of the flower so anyone can create a wonderful arrangement with just a few blooms. The Round Ikebana Vase is our most popular shape and features a circular foot that gives it the appearance of floating on your table. Each vase measures 5 3/4 inches in diameter and is handmade of fine porcelain at our studio in Georgetown Maine. They are individually glazed, decorated, fired in our kiln at 2500 degrees, and finally finished by permanently affixing a pin frog inside the vase. The prongs of the pin frog pierce the stems of your flowers and allow them to absorb water much longer than any traditional vase. This significantly prolongs the life of your blooms, in some instances to up to 3 weeks. Like all of our products, they are hand made in the USA by local artists.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51aox22s3HL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Georgetown Pottery","source_asin":"B00CDSYDO6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-706499","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CDSYDO6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CDSYDO6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
