window.products.push({"id":706510,"name":"Magnet Pal MP-Blue Most Powerful Magnet Ever Made","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.61,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91PsnX1yqPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Here at Magnet Pal, we offer the most powerful magnet ever made. Just how powerful is it? Well, it can hold up to 12 pounds of metal for starters! Not bad for a guy smaller than the end of your finger. Not only that, it is among the most versatile magnets on the market. Every toolbox needs a MagnetPAL. Attach drill bits, screws, nails, bolts, and other hardware to a drill, hammer, wrench or tool belt to free your hands so you can work safely. MagnetPAL is an accurate magnetic stud finder, finding screws in wooden wall studs. Easily clean up metal shavings or find lost metal items in a carpet, grass, or even in the sand for items lost overboard. Secured in rust-proof, plastic liner with key attachment, this makes a great magnetic key hider. This multi-purpose magnet offers endless application uses: a magnet key chain holder, nail finder tool, magnetic stud finder, or hanging tools, keys, or signs to name a few. Rare earth magnets such as Neodymium are brittle and normally shatter in everyday use. MagnetPAL's strong plastic housing makes MagnetPAL durable enough for the rigors of the workshop. Uncoated Neodymium magnets become more brittle as they become stronger. MagnetPAL is wrapped in strong ABS plastic to make the rare earth metals more powerful, eliminating shattering. The molded loop at top allows you to attach almost anything. You will be amazed by what this tiny magnet can lift. You can rely on it for whatever you need. Comes in various colors, including Black, Red, Blue, Green, Yellow, Orange, Grey, and Pink. Weighs only a third of an ounce, and is 1” x ½” x ½”. Why trust second best when it comes to the tools you need to depend on? You can rely on our magnets to hold up their end of the deal, staying strong and convenient when you need them.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91PsnX1yqPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MagnetPAL","source_asin":"B00G1XQ6NK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-706510","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00G1XQ6NK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00G1XQ6NK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
