window.products.push({"id":706589,"name":"Kiaitre Food Scales -Kitchen Digital Scale Rechargeable Scale Kitchen with Tare Function, Food Scale Tools with 1g/0.04oz Precise Graduation for Cooki","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WdvUxLYlL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Precision Food Scale】With a sleek stainless steel and white design, the Kiaitre Digital Kitchen Scale is made for contemporary kitchens. Unlike an analog balance scale, our digital kitchen scale is a high-quality scale that gives a more correct weight reading. Our digital scales offer precise ingredient measurements which can hold up to 5000 grams (about 11 pounds), with precision to 1 gram or 0.04 ounces.【Please fully charge when using it for the first time.】 【Multifunction Kitchen Scale】Kiaitre cooking scale is particularly versatile due to its features two buttons-one for tare and power and one for unit conversion. Our digital kitchen scale can easily measure water, milk, because it can automatically subtracts the weight of a bowl or container. The large LCD display shows you metric or standard weights and volume measurements: g, kg, lb,oz,ml,mike ml, so you're able to convert between recipes when needed. 【Easy to Store & Clean】Kiaitre digital kitchen scales are small, lightweight, and take up very little space on a kitchen counter. Our food scale has brushed stainless steel finish which makes this scale professional and practical. You can using wipes on the platform and it cleans right up without streaking. You can use by two 1.5V AAA batteries or USB charging cable and it has low battery display, overload display and has an 3 minutes auto-shutoff feature for energy conservation. 【Exercise Portion Control】Our digital food scale works best on a flat surface. Many people measure their portions before they eat as part of a healthy lifestyle. Our digital scale makes it easy to measure and portion out food according to serving sizes. This is great for cooking up a complex dinner or prepping the precise amount of protein for a week’s worth of nutritious meals. 【100% Satisfaction Service】If you have any questions or concerns, please do not hesitate to contact us. We'll provide you the best solution. Thus, it is also the wise choice as a gift for Christmas, Thanksgiving, Birthday or any festivals. You will get 1*digital kitchen scale, 1*USB charging cable, 2*1.5V AAA batteries, 1*instruction manual.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WdvUxLYlL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kiaitre","source_asin":"B086GCM4KK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-706589","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086GCM4KK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086GCM4KK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":706590,"name":"Calphalon Enamel Cast Iron 12 Inch Fry Pan, Cabernet Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31cwFmNdmnL._AC_.jpg","description":"Whether you're hosting an intimate dinner party or a grand buffet, Calphalon Enamel Cast Iron cookware's rich enamel color and sleek, modern silhouettes make elegant entertaining easy. Ideal for stovetop or oven use and for both savory and sweet recipes, Calphalon Enamel Cast Iron cookware offers tremendous versatility. It creates the perfect environment for slowly simmering meats and potatoes. The cookware's domed cover design features a dimpled interior to collect and redistribute moisture to foods as they cook. Chicken soup, beef stew and other homey favorites cook up tender and flavorful. The cookware is also perfectly suited to casseroles, cobblers and baked pasta dishes. Calphalon Enamel Cast Iron cookware is as durable as it is beautiful. All pans feature a porcelain enamel exterior surface that resists chipping and scratching. Fry pans and grill pans feature a black satin enamel interior that requires no pre-seasoning. The perfect choice for soups, stews and pot roasted meats and poultry. Wide flat bottom is ideal for browning ingredients prior to adding liquids and seasonings. Large, oval handles make it easy to move pans from stovetop to oven to table. Heavy-gauge cast iron keeps helps keep foods warmer longer, too.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31cwFmNdmnL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Calphalon","source_asin":"B000QFPM3E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-706590","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000QFPM3E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000QFPM3E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
