window.products.push({"id":706635,"name":"NUWAVE Infinity Blender 64oz – Professional Grade, Self-Cleaning - 6 presets & 10 Speed Settings for Shakes, Smoothies, Nut Butters, Crushed Ice & Mor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":299.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iJ-AWvHEL._AC_SL1172_.jpg","description":"A SMOOTHER, CREAMIER BLEND IN SECONDS - The laser-cut stainless steel blades are sharper, thinner and stronger than most blender blades to slice foods more efficiently while creating less oxidation for a smoother, tastier blend. And with speeds as high as 17,000 RPM, it makes smoothies 30% faster than other blenders. The blades can even spin fast enough to generate friction heat, allowing you to cook piping hot soups right in the blender. BLEND JUST ABOUT ANYTHING – The Nuwave Infinity Moxie Blender has an 1500 watt motor….that’s 2.5 horsepower…or in other words, as powerful as two and a half horses! This amazing machine can handle the toughest ingredients without overheating, leaving you with all the flavors and nutrients. A BLENDER FOR EVERY OCCASION – Whether you’re a gym goer looking for a protein shake maker, a bartender looking for the perfect margarita blender, or a restaurant or other commercial kitchen, this pro blender can handle your workload with ease. The built in presets and speed options are designed to assist with any blending job. THE LAST BLENDER YOU’LL EVER NEED – Our Nuwave Infinity Moxie Blender can run as many as 15,000 cycles. That’s over 100 years of blending without slowing down. The BPA-free, stain-resistant Tritan (toughest in the industry) jar is built to last as well. This unit also comes with a free plunger (blender stick) and blade scraper so you have everything you need to prepare your favorite blended treats. SELF CLEANING – One of the six presets in this blender is a self clean mode. Just add a little soap and water, blend, and the Infinity Moxie takes care of the rest.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iJ-AWvHEL._AC_SL1172_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nuwave","source_asin":"B09VCRB1QB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-706635","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VCRB1QB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VCRB1QB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
