window.products.push({"id":706644,"name":"At times our own light goes out and is rekindled by a spark from another person. Each of us has cause to think with deep gratitude of... Albert Schwei","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SZjuhxONL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"At times our own light goes out and is rekindled by a spark from another person. Each of us has cause to think with deep gratitude of those who have lighted the flame within us. Albert Schweitzer Timber Creek Design carved wood signs are an elegant alternative to signs with painted or vinyl lettering. When letters are carved into the sign they can never peel off. Painted and vinyl lettering is flat, where carved letters have a 3 dimensional effect that adds depth and beauty making our carved wood signs much more decorative. Our decorative signs and plaques are machine carved to perfection, making them a beautiful addition to your home.We have many designs and quotes to choose from, including love quotes, inspirational quotes, funny quotes, quotes about life, motivational quotes, cute quotes, famous quotes, friendship quotes, family quotes, relationship quotes, bible verses, LDS Mormon messages, gifts for Grandma and grandparents, Christmas quotes, Thanksgiving quotes, sports quotes, dog quotes, cat quotes, baby quotes, children quotes, freedom quotes, kitchen quotes, and more. We also have a great selection of family established signs and personalized signs that make great wedding anniversary gifts, Father’s Day gifts, and Mother’s Day gifts. We also offer custom wood signs when you want something specific and can’t find what you’re looking for or want to add your personal touch to the perfect gift.The back is completely finished for table display. Wood signs are for indoor use.Easel sold separately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SZjuhxONL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TimberCreekDesign","source_asin":"B004TO2F2O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-706644","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004TO2F2O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004TO2F2O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":706645,"name":"Norwegian Elkhound Made in UK Artistic Style Dog Figurine Collection","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.8,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PxrS4Xc4L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This is exquisite, dignified, and expensive-looking Dog Figurine made of good quality metal (composition metal with antique silver-looking finish) manufactured by a dog accessory maker with long tradition and history of more than 50 years in Britain.The pieces are made in highly artistic finish whose characteristics of each dog type and coat have been precisely and finely replicated.Many of the products are designed by a British artisanal designer of the day, and each piece of any dog type is genuinely and finely crafted with an artistic taste. These chic silver or gold-colored items can be used by owners of a dog with any hair color, making the items highly popular in the U.K., the home country.All pieces are, even today, carefully handcrafted by British artisans, one by one.*Please note that although we pay extra care so that the product images look the same as the actual ones, colors or hue may not be accurately displayed on the screen due to the light environment (indoor/outdoor) or weather, or on the type of monitor of your personal computer or other device.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PxrS4Xc4L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DOG ARTS JP","source_asin":"B00HDBOF8W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-706645","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00HDBOF8W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00HDBOF8W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
