window.products.push({"id":706698,"name":"Modern Night Light Wall Clock, 12 Inch Glow in The Dark Wall Clock, Silent Non-Ticking Quartz Luminous Wall Clocks, Battery Operated, for Living Room,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710wwjUZQQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"『Glow in the Dark Wall Clock』 The wall clocks hands and numbers on the dial will automatically glow at night so that you can get the time. The more sunlight or fluorescent light it can absorb during the day, the better it will glow at night, and as the energy is released, the brightness of the light will gradually decrease. 『Non-ticking & Silent Running』The luminous wall clock has premium quality of the precise quartz movement guarantee accurate time and keep a silent environment when the second hand is moving. Say goodbye to the annoying ticking. 『Perfect Wall Decoration』This wall clock suitable for living room, bedroom, kitchen, office, study, garage, meeting room, class room, church and any other places which needs a silent environment. Create your own custom clock for your family home, or gift one to family and friends as a housewarming gift or wedding gift! 『Simple to Install』Our wall clock is hook included allows easy installation, just put a small nail through the plastic hook and it securely hangs on your wall within a few seconds. 『Battery Operated Clock』The luminous wall clock powered by one AA battery (not included). Please avoid using rechargeable batteries, which will shorten the life of the wall clock movement and affect the accuracy of the time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710wwjUZQQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brmeday","source_asin":"B09JP5G4MD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-706698","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JP5G4MD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JP5G4MD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
