window.products.push({"id":706703,"name":"AYRELY Battery Operated Cordless Digital Alarm Clock with Date,Temperature,Smart Sensor Light,12/24Hr,Snooze for Bedrooms,Office,Heavy Sleepers,Kids,G","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WuyCtN4gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Large Display Digital Clock】Multifunctional large digital numbers is to display time (12/24hr), temperature (°C or °F)，date and alarming time. They are shown clearly and comfortable for eyes. Big bold numbers is friendly to kids and the elderly. Concise style makes it a good decoration for your home or office. 【Ascending Alarm and Big Snooze Button】It raises the alarm gradually to awake users gently. The alarm goes off with a gradual beep for 60 seconds, then it stops itself. The SNOOZE button on the top is big and easy to find. Press the SNOOZE button, the alarm will pause for 5 minutes and then sound again. 【Smart sensor Light Activated at Night】Turn on sensor switch, the clock will automatically give off soft blue light in darkness. Or press SNOOZE/LIGHT button, it will light up the background for 5 seconds. 【Battery Operated Alarm Clock】Since it is battery powered you can put it wherever you want to. It is powered by 3*AAA carbon batteries (not included). 【Product Warranty and 24 Hours Customer Service】We provide a 30-day refunding service or re-delivering service unconditionally, a 18-month warranty and lifetime customer service. Please feel free to contact us if there are any issues, and we will try our best to assist you at the first time. We hope to bring an inspirational shopping experience for our customers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WuyCtN4gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AYRELY","source_asin":"B07VSNLKYY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-706703","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VSNLKYY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VSNLKYY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":706704,"name":"Chinese Wu Lou | Hu Lu Gourd Key Chain Hanging Charm Bell Feng Shui Protection","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91j74n2GOzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"One can use Wu Lou in an abundance of ways around the home; these uses serve as both Feng Shui cures and enhancers. There are many symbols of longevity; one of these is Wu Lou, which can bring a profusion of blessings into the home. This special bottle gourd has been an icon of longevity, good health, and prosperity for many centuries. The Wu Lou, also known as the calabash is an important tool used in enhancing the effects of Feng Shui. The traditional of the Wu Lou started in ancient China, when gourds served the purpose of carrying water on long embarkments. In addition to simply water, medicine was also stored in the gourds; this is where the image of it as a “symbol of health, vitality and immortality ” was derived. The shape itself of the Wu Lou plays an important role in its image; it is a depiction of heaven and earth unified. The top half of the gourd symbolizes heaven, and the bottom half is earth. The use of the gourd by humans indicates the harmony between earth, heaven and humanity. The Wu Lou is also said to have the ability to absorb bad chi, for the reason that Taoist monks use the gourd to incarcerate evil spirits. According to Chinese mythology, monks and deities of the Taoist belief made use of the gourd, trapping evil presences inside to prevent them from causing misdemeanour. This is where the Wu Lou got the ideology of being able to absorb negative chi in your surrounding. When a Wu Lou is being used for Feng Shui, it is imperative to attach a red thread around the “neck” to enhance its energy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91j74n2GOzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beijing","source_asin":"B01M8P4Z3W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-706704","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M8P4Z3W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M8P4Z3W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
