window.products.push({"id":706830,"name":"BRASSTAR Cast Iron Annunciation Bird Wall Hooks Plant Hangers – Decorative Birds Wall Mounted Coat Hook - Rustic Cast Iron Metal Flower Basket Hanger ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51G6fNb4VKL._AC_SL1050_.jpg","description":"Product Specifications: --Size: 5.90in in length, 1.10in in width, 8.46in in height. ---Net Weight: 8.21oz. --Material: cast iron and rustic cast iron, fine finished. Made by best hands. Made to last. --Packaging Method: brand-new wrapped in bubble film, and packed in a professional product packing case. The product will arrive in best condition, directly from the craftsman¡¯s studio. --Package Content: One cast iron annunciation bird wall hooks/hanger --Note: Due to every Metal wall hook that we create is handmade, the dimensions may vary slightly from Product to product. Product Description: Adding style and functionality to your Outdoor or indoor space with an iron plant hanger hook Doesn¡¯t need to be complicated. Simply find a flat surface on which the wrought iron hook can be mounted and hang whatever you desire. These incredibly functional hooks are sure to remain sturdy if installed on a surface that provides it with enough support with proper hardware. Handmade wrought with cast iron and rustic cast iron: Our angled upcrooked hooks are forged from square stock for increased strength and rigidity. The square Hammered look has a craftsman style that fits with a vintage, rustic, or artisan decorative style. Where to use the hooks/hangers? For all outdoor/indoor ornaments: This decorative upcrooked annunciation bird wall hooks/hanger is ideal for hanging your favorite indoor and outdoor decorations. It measures 5.9 inches in length making it suitable for a lantern, wind chime, bird feeder, flower basket or planter. Attach to a smooth, flat surface with the stainless-steel screws provided. We thank you for choosing our product. If you have any further questions, please contact us.  With blessing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51G6fNb4VKL._AC_SL1050_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BRASSTAR","source_asin":"B07WHT7KLQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-706830","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WHT7KLQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WHT7KLQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":706831,"name":"Upgrade Hand Mixer，Lightweight Handheld Mixer,7 Speed Handheld Mixer,2 Beater Sticks & 2 Dough Sticks for Kitchen Baking Cake Egg Cream Food，Baking & ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51V67Mvp67L._AC_SL1186_.jpg","description":"7-Speed Electric Hand Mixer Whisk Egg Beater- Hand mixer is with 1 to 7 different speed settings and turbo function, allow you to achieve high quality results from stiring dry flour, jam, eggs, butter, salad dressings,cake and cream efficiently.soft dough to stiring mashed. The soft start function makes the beater gradually reach the selected speed to help prevent ingredient splashing. High-quality stainless steel accessories-including 2 beaters, 2 dough hooks. The durable stainless steel dough hooks make mixing dough and heavier cake mixes easy.The stainless steel beaters are perfect for whisking egg whites, and other liquid ingredients. All the accessories are easy to clean and dishwasher safe. Perfect kitchen accessories-Electric Hand Mixer to blend, beat, whip, knead, mix eggs or cream provide you with a comfortable and safe user experience. This hand mixer’s weighing just over 1.2 lbs,7.1 x 5.1 x 2.8 inches fit for a smaller kitchen, dormitory, RV traveling. Splash proof-Avoid ingredients splash, the lightweight hand mixer electric features an ergonomic grip also benefits from a compact and light-weight design makes comfortable operation and adjust the speed to 0, press the eject button, the attachments will be ejected easily. Quality Warranty-We are confident in the quality of our Electric Hand Mixer.If you are not satisfied our products with any reason, please contact us. We refund in full.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51V67Mvp67L._AC_SL1186_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"N-brand","source_asin":"B08QFZRF4W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-706831","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QFZRF4W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QFZRF4W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":706832,"name":"Wanderer Above the Sea of Fog By Caspar David Custom Framed Art Print","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":64.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VrlrkauEL._AC_.jpg","description":"Wanderer above the Sea of Fog (1818). Kunsthalle Hamburg. This well-known and especially Romantic masterpiece was described by the writer John Lewis Gaddis as leaving a contradictory impression, \"suggesting at once mastery over a landscape and the insignificance of the individual within it. We see no face, so it's impossible to know whether the prospect facing the young man is exhilarating, or terrifying, or both.\" The prints we carry are produced using either the lithographic or serigraphic printing process, and are printed on high quality archival acid free paper. Most prints are on a thick (120 pound or higher) stock of paper. The print is dry mounted on foam core in a hot vaccum press giving a perfectly flat and smooth appearance to the image. This mounting process also insures the print will never fold or fade with age or moisture.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VrlrkauEL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"brooklyn art","source_asin":"B00AHPGOAS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-706832","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00AHPGOAS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00AHPGOAS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
