window.products.push({"id":706846,"name":"WOODERFUL LIFE Wooden Music Box | Forest Castle | 1064502 | Hand Painting Most Popular Design Wonderful Gift for Family & Valentines Day Gifts from Su","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oDROAth6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BRAND: Wooderful life is a Taiwan brand that specializes in wooden music boxes, home accessories and wooden crafts. The brand name combines the words of \"wood\", \"wonderful\" and \"life\". Every single piece of wooden craft from Wooderful life is designed creatively and aesthetically to complement your lifestyle. CORE MOVEMENT: Inheriting the legacy of precise manufacturing skills from Japan, the handmade movements are a sophisticated musical instrument driven by mechanical vibration. Each of them is tested manually with strict standards to achieve the perfect melody. DESIGN: Wooden music box design was coming from the base of physical dynamics and magnets and run in different fun movements including different way of 360 degrees rotation, up and down movement, swaying, some product with small magnetic cars and trains. From design concepts, sketches, prototyping, modify mechanical construction to mass production, 60 full-time designers and thousands of factory employees work together to present the best works. CRAFT: Cherishing the best natural gift-wood from nature, we are dedicated to innovating techniques and constantly optimizing processes. Each music box has dozens to hundreds small parts and goes through at least 20 processes to be finished. The processes include lathe, mill, drill, modeling, cut, polishing, metal stamping, laser, oil spray, hand painting, pad printing, resin, injection molding, etc, it combines both efficient manufacturing process and unrepeatable handcraft techniques. SUSTAINABLE WOOD: Selecting of premium hardwoods from legal sources, the wood of Wooderful life mainly comes from Northern America well managed forestry supply chain. Each piece of wood has its unique texture. The warm touching of Wooderful life music box will bring you to get close to nature and listen to the story of forest.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oDROAth6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WOODERFUL LIFE","source_asin":"B09MK4YQX7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-706846","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MK4YQX7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MK4YQX7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
