window.products.push({"id":706941,"name":"Yeeper Electric Meat Slicer for Home Use, with CHILD LOCK & CLEAN KITS & REINFORCED PUSHER, 7.5\" Deli Food Slicer Machine for Frozen Meat Bread Salami","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8198ouzs8NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Versatile Helper in Kitchen. Backed by powerful motor and sharp blade, you can accurately cut various of food from ultra-thin to about 3/4 inch, for example, cheese, beef jerky, deli, bread, ham, roast beef, frozen meat ,turkey Breast,bacon,vegetables and fruits jerk. It will be your right-hand man in the kitchen, saving you precious time to spend with your family. Exclusively Equipped with Child Lock.The Yeeper meat slicer is one of the only two meat slicers equipped with child safety lock. Compared with the meat slicer without child lock, it needs to move the Lock paddle to START the machine, which can prevent children from turning on the machine by mistake. At the same price, why don’t you buy a safer meat slicer. 15 Seconds Fully Disassemble. In order to facilitate the user's cleaning, Yeeper meat slicer can be completely disassembled within 15 seconds. The Slicer blade, slide rod, food carriage, food holder, except the motor, can be easily disassembled quickly without using any tools. Compared to other machines which can only be disassembled the food holder and slicer blade, it is easier to clean. Seamless Body & Reinforce Hand Push. There is crevice behind the blade of the previous generation meat slicer for heat dissipation, so the meat scraps may get stuck this hole. Our meat slicer optimizes the heat dissipation structure, and there is no hole behind the blade. On the other hand, our food pusher is also upgraded from the previous brittle material to a new material with higher strength,it is more durable. Yeeper's World Class Support. At Yeeper, we truly care about you and your satisfaction, reaaallllyyyy care. Maybe there is no 100% perfect product in this world, but we will try our best to provide 100% perfect service. Should you not be delighted with your purchase or our products, please contact us so we can do our best to put it right. Bid with confidence!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8198ouzs8NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yeeper","source_asin":"B08F52K6R3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-706941","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08F52K6R3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08F52K6R3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
