window.products.push({"id":706953,"name":"Evitany Ultra Soft Fluffy Area Rugs Anti-Slip Plush Carpets High Pile Shaggy Tie-Dye Rugs for Living Room, Bedroom, Kids Room (Light Pink, 2.6×4 ft)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81k2YsbV6-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Super Soft Rug: Our fluffy rugs are made of high-density and high-pile fiber plush materials, which are smooth, soft and not easy to shed. The high resilience sponge in the middle can increase the softness of the plush carpet and reduce the pressure on your feet. Stepping on the shaggy rug can relieve your fatigue of the day. Home Decor Rug: This area rug is made of non-toxic materials and made with the latest tie-dyeing process, which has excellent skin affinity and resistance to discoloration. The tie-dye rug adds beauty and comfort to the room. It creates a warm and lively atmosphere and is an ideal choice for room decoration. Multi-Room Use: Our room decor rugs can be used in living rooms, bedrooms, children's rooms, nurseries, etc. We offer a variety of sizes and colors for you to choose from. The small rugs fit under the coffee table, and the large rugs fit next to the sofa or bed. You can choose the room rug according to your preferences. Anti-skid Bottom: The bottom of the area carpet is made of high-quality non-woven fabric, which is durable and will not damage the floor. Thousands of non-slip PVC spots can enhance the friction between the carpet and the floor and prevent the carpet from sliding on the floor. The non-slip bottom design is suitable for all kinds of floors. Easy To Clean: It is recommended to wash or wipe the fluffy carpet manually, and please air dry or hang the carpet to dry after washing. You can also use a low power hand-held vacuum cleaner to remove the dust on the fur rug. Try not to machine wash and do not use bleach.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81k2YsbV6-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Evitany","source_asin":"B09CYP3H5R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-706953","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CYP3H5R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CYP3H5R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
