window.products.push({"id":706956,"name":"Beeswax Wrap Reusable Food Wrap Set – 3 Beeswax Wraps for Food, Leftovers, Lunch – Durable Cotton & Sustainably Harvested Beeswax – Long-Lasting, Secu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91i57AGD8ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BEESWAX FOOD WRAPS are a great way to REDUCE PLASTIC WASTE – but many bees wax wraps don’t adhere well and LOSE THEIR STICKING POWER QUICKLY, peeling off and letting food get stale. At White Ladle, we’ve developed our Reusable Beeswax Food Wrap Set to provide a LONGER-LASTING, MORE SECURE SEAL throughout its life cycle, to keep food fresher. With our set of 3 ASSORTED-SIZE beeswax wrappers, we’ve got your reusable food storage needs covered, from PACKING LUNCHES to STORING LEFTOVERS. THE AVERAGE BEES WAX WRAP is stiff & tough to shape over your food, and LOSES ITS FORM QUICKLY. Wrapping up your food shouldn’t be a challenge! Our wax wraps for food reusable food covers are designed to be EXTRA PLIABLE and EASY TO SHAPE, using the warmth of your hands to soften and FORM EASILY OVER CONTAINERS, CANS, and BOWLS – or DIRECTLY ONTO BREAD, CHEESE, FRUITS & VEGGIES. So you can wrap up leftovers quickly, PACK THE KIDS’ LUNCHES in a snap, and keep avocado halves green in the fridge. WASHABLE & REUSABLE – Designed to help REDUCE OUR FOOTPRINT on our beautiful planet, these beeswax food covers are made to last through ABOUT A YEAR OF REGULAR USE. Simply hand wash with cool water and drip dry between uses. They’re the perfect choice for ZERO-WASTE HOMES – and the CUSTOM-DESIGNED PRINTS on our bees wax wrappers are SO CHARMING, you’ll want to GIFT THEM to FRIENDS and FAMILY! These bee wax wraps may be composted or used as campfire starters at the end of their life cycle. THE SAFER CHOICE FOR YOU and YOUR FAMILY – Our beeswax wraps for food reusable wrappers are crafted with ONLY CLEAN, NATURAL INGREDIENTS: durable cotton, SUSTAINABLY HARVESTED BEESWAX sourced from independent beekeepers, jojoba oil, and pine resin. That means NO SYNTHETIC CHEMICALS leaching into your food from plastic containers – and nothing goes into the landfill! AT WHITE LADLE, WE BELIEVE that thoughtfully sourced products can propel us to A MORE SUSTAINABLE FUTURE, where we can again LIVE IN HARMONY WITH NATURE. We’re committed to creating LONG-LASTING, INTUITIVELY DESIGNED products made with sustainable, ethically sourced materials, and we only partner with factories that adhere to HIGH STANDARDS for their facilities and working conditions. If for any reason you don’t love your reusable wax food wrap, our team is standing by to help make it right.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91i57AGD8ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"White Ladle","source_asin":"B08SZKWRV4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-706956","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SZKWRV4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SZKWRV4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":706957,"name":"JPHMN 24inch Bar Stools Set of 2 Backless Kitchen Counter Height Bar Stool with Footrest Upholstered Faux Leather Dining Stool, Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iHcY3NnYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【STYLISH BACKLESS BAR STOOLS】Nicely stitched PU leather with matte black powder-coated steel base, the modern and minimalist design of the bar stool fits in with both contemporary and traditional decor. 【STURDY SQUARE BAR STOOLS】Solid metal frame with built-in footrest makes the counter stool more sturdy, max loading capacity up to 300 pounds, and could be used for years without problem. 【STAIN RESISTANT PU LEATHER STOOLS】: The PU leather is free stain resistance. It is extreamly easy to clean and maintain as stain will just stay on the surface, which keeps you free from trouble of stains while enjoying the food and drink. 【WIDE APPLICATION】Bar stool's industrial modern design and counter height is perfect for any dining table, kitchen counter, island, or home bar. Multi-functional use in home, restaurant, bar, pub, bistro, coffee bar, bedrooms, cafe, etc 【EASY ASSEMBLE COUNTER STOOLS】The barstools could be assembled easily with introduction brochure and PU leather seats are easy to clean for long-term use. It is recommended to leave each screw a little loose till all of the screws are in, and then tighten all of them. Please feel free to contact us if there is any problem.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iHcY3NnYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JPHMN","source_asin":"B09X7Q947Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-706957","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09X7Q947Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09X7Q947Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
